763
00:39:54,314 --> 00:39:56,732
- Coincidences are rare.
- [John] When I saw your military record,

764
00:39:56,733 --> 00:39:58,859
I told those federal boys

765
00:39:58,860 --> 00:40:01,320
that you'd be a hard man to scare away.

766
00:40:01,321 --> 00:40:04,990
And I'll be damned if you aren't
out there running circles around 'em.

767
00:40:04,991 --> 00:40:06,992
He's already found out
more than they have.

768
00:40:06,993 --> 00:40:08,119
Who are they?

769
00:40:08,120 --> 00:40:09,537
I can't say.

770
00:40:09,538 --> 00:40:10,955
Why is the CIA involved?

771
00:40:10,956 --> 00:40:12,957
Don't know.
I got nothing to do with the CIA.

772
00:40:12,958 --> 00:40:14,333
Would you tell me if you did?

773
00:40:14,334 --> 00:40:16,085
Probably not.

774
00:40:16,086 --> 00:40:19,339
But I wouldn't pretend not to know,
'cause I don't have time for bullshit.

775
00:40:20,257 --> 00:40:21,633
Did you know Anna Merrick?

776
00:40:22,717 --> 00:40:24,885
Never heard of her
before early yesterday morning,

777
00:40:24,886 --> 00:40:27,847
when I got a courtesy call from those feds

778
00:40:27,848 --> 00:40:30,934
who told me that she might be involved
in a minor data breach.

779
00:40:32,018 --> 00:40:34,228
Did she really say my husband's name
before she died,

780
00:40:34,229 --> 00:40:37,773
or did you get it from the CIA
like you told the investigators?

781
00:40:37,774 --> 00:40:39,150
Neither.

782
00:40:39,151 --> 00:40:40,234
Then you're a liar.

783
00:40:40,235 --> 00:40:41,819
Sometimes.

784
00:40:41,820 --> 00:40:44,280
Well, who did you hear my name from?

785
00:40:44,281 --> 00:40:46,782
From someone who said
the data Anna Merrick took

786
00:40:46,783 --> 00:40:48,367
was connected
to a Delta mission you were on

787
00:40:48,368 --> 00:40:50,202
in Indonesia back in the '90s.

788
00:40:50,203 --> 00:40:53,038
Anna Merrick worked
for Human Resources Command.

789
00:40:53,039 --> 00:40:55,249
Specific Delta mission information

790
00:40:55,250 --> 00:40:57,751
is locked away where an HRC file clerk

791
00:40:57,752 --> 00:40:59,962
couldn't get to it even if she wanted to.

792
00:40:59,963 --> 00:41:02,381
Anna Merrick couldn't have had access
to anything more than

793
00:41:02,382 --> 00:41:05,593
general details.
Dates and units and such.

794
00:41:05,594 --> 00:41:07,761
The person who gave me your name
wouldn't need more than that

795
00:41:07,762 --> 00:41:09,221
to prove what she's trying to prove.

796
00:41:09,222 --> 00:41:10,807
Which is?

797
00:41:14,936 --> 00:41:17,188
Something of a delicate nature.

798
00:41:17,189 --> 00:41:19,982
My wife's tougher than you and me
covered in cowhide.

799
00:41:19,983 --> 00:41:21,902
So, whatever you got, say it.

800
00:41:23,445 --> 00:41:26,030
Dates and units are more than enough
to prove that you were in-country

801
00:41:26,031 --> 00:41:27,948
when my source was conceived.

802
00:41:27,949 --> 00:41:31,160
That's what this is about?
You think I had an affair?

803
00:41:31,161 --> 00:41:34,121
That there's some love child out there
looking for Daddy?

804
00:41:34,122 --> 00:41:36,081
[short chuckle]

805
00:41:36,082 --> 00:41:38,250
Well, I can absolutely assure you

806
00:41:38,251 --> 00:41:39,835
that when I was in-country,

807
00:41:39,836 --> 00:41:42,504
my powder wasn't
the only thing I kept dry.

808
00:41:42,505 --> 00:41:46,133
Hell, if my DNA is all it's gonna take

809
00:41:46,134 --> 00:41:47,636
to get you to leave us alone...

810
00:41:49,888 --> 00:41:52,181
Here you go. Run the test.

811
00:41:52,182 --> 00:41:55,268
You'll see that I did not
father any children in Indonesia.

812
00:41:57,145 --> 00:41:58,647
That won't be necessary.

813
00:41:59,773 --> 00:42:01,274
I believe you.

814
00:42:03,944 --> 00:42:06,654
You just had to come and look me
in the eye and ask me the question.

815
00:42:06,655 --> 00:42:08,948
But you had already begun to suspect that

816
00:42:08,949 --> 00:42:10,825
there was more to this
than what you've been told.

817
00:42:12,327 --> 00:42:16,038
I can't see the CIA being so involved
in a domestic political sex scandal

818
00:42:16,039 --> 00:42:18,958
that they'd kidnap
three American citizens on U.S. soil.

819
00:42:18,959 --> 00:42:20,460
Two of 'em cops.

820
00:42:21,753 --> 00:42:23,171
Me neither.

821
00:42:24,339 --> 00:42:27,342
We've elected presidents
after sex scandals.

822
00:42:28,426 --> 00:42:31,220
People don't seem to care much
about that anymore.

823
00:42:31,221 --> 00:42:33,264
CIA seems to care.

824
00:42:33,265 --> 00:42:35,057
Well...

825
00:42:35,058 --> 00:42:37,060
their involvement troubles me, too.

826
00:42:38,561 --> 00:42:41,314
My friends who wouldn't
show you their IDs are looking into that.

827
00:42:42,899 --> 00:42:44,775
Of course, you understand
that I can't give you

828
00:42:44,776 --> 00:42:47,111
any details of my Delta missions,

829
00:42:47,112 --> 00:42:49,405
but what I can assure you
is that no crimes

830
00:42:49,406 --> 00:42:51,073
were committed by me or any of my men.

831
00:42:51,074 --> 00:42:54,243
My husband's been
in the political spotlight long enough

832
00:42:54,244 --> 00:42:56,328
that if there was anything to find,

833
00:42:56,329 --> 00:42:58,998
some muckraker would've found it by now.

834
00:42:58,999 --> 00:43:01,709
Be that as it may, Mrs. Sampson,

835
00:43:01,710 --> 00:43:04,044
Anna Merrick didn't kill herself
over nothing.

836
00:43:04,045 --> 00:43:05,546
No one ever does.

837
00:43:05,547 --> 00:43:07,131
[solemn music playing]

838
00:43:07,132 --> 00:43:08,842
But it was nothing to do with me.

839
00:43:09,926 --> 00:43:12,052
I suggest

840
00:43:12,053 --> 00:43:13,971
you stand down,

841
00:43:13,972 --> 00:43:15,265
let the authorities handle it.

842
00:43:16,558 --> 00:43:17,808
I can't do that.

843
00:43:17,809 --> 00:43:19,601
Why not just walk away?

844
00:43:19,602 --> 00:43:22,355
Lots of people have been
asking me that lately.

845
00:43:23,857 --> 00:43:25,316
I have my reasons.

846
00:43:25,317 --> 00:43:27,568
Well, suit yourself.

847
00:43:27,569 --> 00:43:29,611
Bottom line:

848
00:43:29,612 --> 00:43:31,865
we are as in the dark
on this thing as you are.

849
00:43:34,784 --> 00:43:36,952
Okay. [clears throat]

850
00:43:36,953 --> 00:43:38,620
For what it's worth, Reacher,

851
00:43:38,621 --> 00:43:40,539
we hope the Merrick boy turns up safe

852
00:43:40,540 --> 00:43:42,583
and we're truly saddened
to hear that his mother

853
00:43:42,584 --> 00:43:44,169
felt compelled to take her own life.

854
00:43:45,378 --> 00:43:47,046
But there's nothing more we can do.

855
00:43:47,047 --> 00:43:49,173
And we need to get to Baltimore.

856
00:43:49,174 --> 00:43:52,302
Fundraiser, first thing in the morning,
and it's late, so if you'll excuse us.

857
00:43:54,512 --> 00:43:56,014
Ma'am.

858
00:43:59,267 --> 00:44:01,352
[door opens]

859
00:44:01,353 --> 00:44:02,854
[door closes]

860
00:44:07,233 --> 00:44:09,610
Hey. How'd it go?

861
00:44:09,611 --> 00:44:11,612
I don't believe Sampson's behind this.

862
00:44:11,613 --> 00:44:12,613
Then who?

863
00:44:12,614 --> 00:44:14,616
[reporters clamoring]

864
00:44:24,918 --> 00:44:26,794
We need to have a private conversation...

865
00:44:26,795 --> 00:44:27,962
[continues indistinctly]

866
00:44:29,381 --> 00:44:31,423
Hey, who's that guy talking to Sampson?

867
00:44:31,424 --> 00:44:33,717
That's Nolan Cahill.
Sampson's chief of staff.

868
00:44:33,718 --> 00:44:35,136
[Tamara] What's wrong?

869
00:44:36,679 --> 00:44:38,680
Remember when I said
there was a fourth witness on the train

870
00:44:38,681 --> 00:44:39,973
